.SS "TSelf SystemEx\&.IByteSerializable< TSelf >\&.FromBytes (byte[] bytes, long offset, \fBEndian\fP endian)\fR [static]\fP, \fR [abstract]\fP"

.PP
Creates an instance of \fITSelf\fP  from a byte array\&. The method reads the encoded representation starting at the specified \fIoffset\fP  using the given \fIendian\fP  order\&. 
.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIbytes\fP The source buffer containing the binary representation of the value\&. 
.br
\fIoffset\fP The position within \fIbytes\fP  where the encoded data begins\&. 
.br
\fIendian\fP The byte order used to interpret the binary data\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
A reconstructed \fITSelf\fP  instance based on the provided binary data\&. 
.RE
.PP

